让我告诉你为什么。

84
00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:38.020
Anyway, when a show hits 100 episodes and goes into syndication, it means that the network can now start selling the show in a package to different places where they can rerun it.
总之，当一部剧拍到100集并进入联合播出阶段时，意味着电视台现在可以开始把这部剧打包卖给不同的平台，让他们重播。

85
00:03:38.060 --> 00:03:41.500
So it doesn't just run on NBC anymore.
所以它不再只在NBC播出。

86
00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:43.940
It gets on all the cable networks.
它会出现在所有的有线电视网。

87
00:03:44.080 --> 00:03:46.740
Like Comedy Central, how it reruns on Comedy Central.
就像喜剧中心频道，它在喜剧中心频道重播那样。

88
00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:47.260
Right.
没错。

89
00:03:47.540 --> 00:03:51.080
And guys, remember, this predates all streaming.
伙计们，记住，这可是流媒体出现之前的事了。

90
00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:51.900
Yes.
是的。

91
00:03:52.120 --> 00:03:54.160
So this was all kind of a cable thing.
所以这在当时算是有线电视领域的事。

92
00:03:54.160 --> 00:03:57.160
But this meant big money for the network.
但这对电视台来说意味着大笔收入。

93
00:03:57.360 --> 00:04:02.120
I didn't know that, but it makes sense because these other places pay them to have it.
我以前不知道，但这说得通，因为其他平台得付钱给他们才能播出。

94
00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:02.580
Yes.
是的。

95
00:04:02.780 --> 00:04:12.000
But what I think a lot of people don't know is that the actors do not cash in on this unless they are what is called profit participants.
但我认为很多人不知道的是，演员们并不能从中分一杯羹，除非他们是所谓的利润分成参与者。

96
00:04:12.340 --> 00:04:12.660
Oh, yeah.
哦，是啊。

97
00:04:12.780 --> 00:04:13.220
And guess what?
你猜怎么着？

98
00:04:13.280 --> 00:04:13.720
We weren't.
我们不是。

99
00:04:13.920 --> 00:04:14.400
We were not.
我们确实不是。

100
00:04:14.640 --> 00:04:20.320
Now, our union, SAG, does negotiate a small fee for syndicated reruns.
不过，我们的工会，演员工会，确实会为联合重播协商一笔小额费用。

101
00:04:20.520 --> 00:04:22.460
So it's very fun.
所以这真的很有趣。

102
00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:24.900
They're great.
它们很棒。

103
00:04:24.980 --> 00:04:27.160
But they have, you guys, this, like, cascading tier.
但你们知道吗，它们有一种阶梯式递减的机制。

104
00:04:27.300 --> 00:04:28.640
So you get a check and you're like, whoop-hoo.
一开始你收到一张支票，你会觉得，哇哦。

105
00:04:28.860 --> 00:04:29.960
Then the next one's a little lower.
然后下一张就少了一点。

106
00:04:30.100 --> 00:04:30.900
Then it's a little lower.
再下一张又少了一点。

107
00:04:31.020 --> 00:04:31.960
Then it's a little lower.
接着又少了一点。

108
00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:32.960
Then it's a little lower.
然后又少了一点。

109
00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:33.960
Then it's a little lower.
再然后又少了一点。

110
00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:34.580
Yes.
是的。

111
00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:35.780
And then it's for, like, $2.
最后可能就只剩两美元了。

112
00:04:36.540 --> 00:04:40.480
Well, you know that bar that they have called Residuals in Burbank?
你们知道伯班克那家叫“余款”的酒吧吗？

113
00:04:40.480 --> 00:04:42.220
This is a famous bar, you guys.
那可是家很有名的酒吧，伙计们。

114
00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:42.580
Yeah.
没错。

115
00:04:42.680 --> 00:04:44.520
So there's this bar called Residuals.
所以有一家酒吧就叫“余款”。

116
00:04:44.600 --> 00:04:50.360
And if you're an actor and you bring in a residual check that's under $1, they'll give you a free drink.
如果你是个演员，拿出一张金额不到一美元的余款支票，他们就会请你喝一杯。

117
00:04:50.360 --> 00:04:52.800
And then they tack your check up on the wall.
然后他们会把你的支票钉在墙上。

118
00:04:53.020 --> 00:04:53.260
Yeah.
是啊。

119
