他们没法让她请一周的假来参加这次野餐。

173
00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:16.920
And then they realized, wait, she would be on maternity leave.
然后他们意识到，等等，她当时应该在休产假。

174
00:07:17.020 --> 00:07:21.980
So they tracked her story-wise as being on maternity leave, and that's why she wasn't there.
所以他们在剧情上安排她去休产假了，这就是她没出现的原因。

175
00:07:22.120 --> 00:07:23.420
Well, that worked out perfect.
嗯，这安排得太完美了。

176
00:07:24.220 --> 00:07:28.760
While the volleyball was a great idea, Ken did share that it was a logistical nightmare
虽然排球是个好主意，但肯分享说这简直是后勤上的噩梦，

177
00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:33.420
because they started filming and they were trying to keep with the rules of volleyball,
因为他们开始拍摄时，试图遵守排球的规则，

178
00:07:33.700 --> 00:07:39.200
which means the teams trade sides depending on score or whatever, but they just had to
也就是队伍要根据比分之类的交换场地，但他们最后不得不

179
00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:39.520
bail.
放弃了。

180
00:07:39.940 --> 00:07:42.580
They had to bail because it just got too complicated.
他们不得不放弃，因为这实在太复杂了。

181
00:07:43.400 --> 00:07:48.060
And Jen said she had this memory of looking over at Ken, and he had a clipboard, and he
珍说她记得有一次看向肯，他拿着一块写字板，

182
00:07:48.060 --> 00:07:54.720
had a little quarter, and he was tracing this coin with a pencil and placing it and mapping
还有一个小硬币，他用铅笔描着硬币，在纸上标记并规划

183
00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:59.500
out where everyone was going to stand and who was serving and who was playing what position
每个人要站的位置，谁发球，谁打什么位置，

184
00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:02.400
because it was so complex to shoot.
因为拍摄起来太复杂了。

185
00:08:02.800 --> 00:08:06.620
I thought it was interesting that they chose volleyball.
我觉得他们选择排球这一点很有意思。

186
00:08:06.620 --> 00:08:13.000
Any company picnic I've ever been to, it's usually softball, but I do see how that people are
我参加过的任何公司野餐通常都是垒球，但我确实明白垒球中人们

187
00:08:13.000 --> 00:08:14.360
really spread out in softball.
站得太分散了。

188
00:08:14.520 --> 00:08:16.120
So I guess that makes sense to me.
所以我猜这对我来说说得通。

189
00:08:16.420 --> 00:08:16.580
Right.
没错。

190
00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:18.600
But I mean, I can't even imagine.
但我意思是，我简直无法想象。

191
00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:20.400
Jen and Paul shared this other thing.
珍和保罗分享了另一件事。

192
00:08:20.880 --> 00:08:25.720
Jen said that her and Paul, as they wrote this episode, they thought that each team had
珍说她和保罗在写这一集时，以为每支队伍有

193
00:08:25.720 --> 00:08:26.500
nine players.
九名球员。

194
00:08:26.860 --> 00:08:30.660
And so they wrote the whole script with each team having nine players.
于是他们按照每队九人写了整个剧本。

195
00:08:30.860 --> 00:08:31.280
Oh, no.
噢，不。

196
00:08:31.280 --> 00:08:35.260
And then they got to the production meeting, and in the production meeting, someone was
然后他们到了制作会议上，在会上，有人说，

197
00:08:35.260 --> 00:08:40.100
