00:08:50.560 --> 00:08:51.880
I'll sprinkle through the episode.
我会穿插在这一集中讲。

203
00:08:52.120 --> 00:08:52.660
All right.
好的。

204
00:08:53.000 --> 00:08:53.380
Angela.
安吉拉。

205
00:08:53.620 --> 00:08:53.860
What?
怎么了？

206
00:08:54.020 --> 00:08:55.180
Great job on that fast fact.
那个冷知识讲得太棒了。

207
00:08:55.320 --> 00:08:56.080
Oh, thank you.
哦，谢谢你。

208
00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:56.920
I really enjoyed that.
我真的很喜欢。

209
00:08:57.340 --> 00:08:57.940
Thanks so much.
太感谢了。

210
00:08:57.940 --> 00:08:58.560
You told me.
你跟我说过。

211
00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:02.160
You were like, Jenna, there's some great stuff about the inspiration behind the episode.
你当时说，珍娜，关于这一集的灵感来源有一些很棒的内容。

212
00:09:02.160 --> 00:09:05.440
And I said, I'm holding a spot for you up in Fast Facts, lady.
我说，我给你在“冷知识”环节留了个位置，女士。

213
00:09:05.700 --> 00:09:05.960
You did.
你确实留了。

214
00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:07.020
All right.
好的。

