00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:35.100
If you've ever been to a park called the Meadows in upstate New York, I'd love to know.
如果你去过纽约州北部一个叫梅多斯的地方，我很想知道。

225
00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:36.380
Fan question.
粉丝提问。

226
00:09:37.040 --> 00:09:42.220
Rayyan from Pakistan would like to know, where did we actually film this episode?
来自巴基斯坦的雷扬想知道，我们实际上是在哪里拍摄这一集的？

227
00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:46.180
Well, we filmed at Calamigos Ranch in Malibu Canyon.
嗯，我们是在马里布峡谷的卡拉米戈斯牧场拍摄的。

228
00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:49.160
It is a beautiful location.
那是一个美丽的地方。

229
00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:53.940
It's kind of nestled into the side of this canyon in the Malibu Mountains.
它坐落在马里布山脉峡谷的一侧。

230
00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:59.760
Did you know it has its own water source from a spring on the property?
你知道它有自己的水源，来自庄园内的一处泉水吗？

231
00:09:59.760 --> 00:10:03.220
I didn't know that, but I know a lot of people get married there.
我不知道，但我知道很多人在那里举行婚礼。

