I've been to a wedding there.
我参加过在那儿举办的婚礼。

233
00:10:05.060 --> 00:10:05.820
You know what?
你知道吗？

234
00:10:06.020 --> 00:10:11.000
Randy Cordray knew about this location because he had been the best man at a wedding there.
兰迪·科德雷知道这个地方，因为他曾在那里当过伴郎。

235
00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:15.940
And when the script came up, he remembered it and suggested it to our locations manager,
当剧本出来时，他想起了这个地方，并向我们的外景经理推荐了它，

236
00:10:16.100 --> 00:10:16.840
Kyle Alexander.
凯尔·亚历山大。

237
00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:20.120
And they scouted it and they all agreed it was perfect.
他们去实地考察后，一致认为这里非常完美。

238
00:10:20.120 --> 00:10:25.540
So now, Angela, you mentioned how Ken Kwapis said like this was a logistically difficult
所以，安吉拉，你刚才提到肯·卡瓦皮斯说这是一次后勤上很困难的

239
00:10:25.540 --> 00:10:26.160
shoot.
拍摄。

240
00:10:26.400 --> 00:10:26.660
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

241
00:10:27.320 --> 00:10:32.420
Randy said this was a very difficult episode to pull off logistically from a production
兰迪说，从制作角度来看，这一集在后勤上非常难搞，

242
00:10:32.420 --> 00:10:35.320
side because we had so many people.
因为我们有太多人了。

243
00:10:35.660 --> 00:10:38.140
So many people and we were in the middle of a canyon.
人太多了，而且我们还在峡谷中间。

244
00:10:38.480 --> 00:10:42.720
He said we had to hire additional crew, including multiple medics.
他说我们不得不雇佣额外的剧组成员，包括多名医护人员。

245
00:10:42.720 --> 00:10:47.340
And we had hydration stations and sunscreen stations.
我们还设置了补水站和防晒霜站。

246
00:10:47.760 --> 00:10:50.280
And Sergio and Alan are caterers.
还有我们的餐饮服务商塞尔吉奥和艾伦。

247
00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:52.080
They had to triple their staff.
他们不得不把员工人数增加到原来的三倍。

248
00:10:52.260 --> 00:10:56.600
They had three lines to serve lunch, like three buffet lines.
他们设置了三条线来供应午餐，就像三条自助餐线一样。

249
00:10:57.140 --> 00:11:03.660
And then Peter and Vartan at craft service, they also had three stations instead of one.
还有负责茶点服务的彼得和瓦尔坦，他们也设置了三个站点，而不是一个。

250
00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:09.680
It was a lot of concern about being able to feed everybody because all the background food,
当时大家非常担心能不能喂饱所有人，因为所有的背景食物，

