00:11:11.500 --> 00:11:12.840
Yeah, it was fakie food.
没错，那是假食物。

253
00:11:13.080 --> 00:11:18.700
It was real food, but it had been at various temperatures that made it sort of unsafe to
其实是真食物，但因为在不同温度下放过，所以吃起来

254
00:11:18.700 --> 00:11:18.860
eat.
不太安全。

