You know what their special business was?
你知道他们的特殊业务是什么吗？

267
00:11:54.660 --> 00:11:55.220
Volleyball?
打排球？

268
00:11:55.600 --> 00:11:55.800
Yeah.
没错。

269
00:11:56.280 --> 00:11:58.140
Playing volleyball for hours on end.
连续打几个小时的排球。

270
00:11:58.700 --> 00:12:00.920
Lady, were you ever a background performer?
女士，你当过背景演员吗？

271
00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:02.020
You know it.
你懂的。

272
00:12:02.020 --> 00:12:03.520
That's how I earned my SAG card.
我就是那样拿到演员工会卡的。

273
00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:04.000
Yeah.
是啊。

274
00:12:04.260 --> 00:12:04.620
Same.
我也是。

275
00:12:04.620 --> 00:12:08.840
