你的特殊业务是什么？

278
00:12:11.840 --> 00:12:13.160
That I could speak Indonesian.
我会说印尼语。

279
00:12:13.940 --> 00:12:14.240
Oh.
哦。

280
00:12:14.520 --> 00:12:14.880
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

281
00:12:15.300 --> 00:12:21.260
My special business was water skiing, bowling, and animal handling.
我的特殊业务是滑水、保龄球和动物驯养。

282
00:12:21.540 --> 00:12:24.680
Oh, I also put I could play tennis and roller skate.
哦，我还写了我能打网球和滑旱冰。

283
00:12:24.820 --> 00:12:24.980
Yeah.
是啊。

284
00:12:24.980 --> 00:12:25.820
Those are a big deal.
那些都很厉害。

285
00:12:25.920 --> 00:12:26.900
Yeah, that's a big deal.
没错，那很厉害。

286
00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:28.900
I was on 90210.
我上过《飞越比佛利》。

287
00:12:29.240 --> 00:12:31.240
Did you have to do any of your special business?
你有展示过你的特殊业务吗？

288
00:12:31.540 --> 00:12:32.080
I didn't.
没有。

