投票会议上，我把选票递给了托莉。

291
00:12:42.980 --> 00:12:45.080
Oh, you got to interact.
哦，你有机会互动了。

292
00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:46.200
Yes, briefly.
是的，短暂地互动了一下。

293
00:12:46.440 --> 00:12:47.040
I said nothing.
我什么都没说。

294
00:12:47.220 --> 00:12:48.540
I just handed some paper to her.
我只是递给她一些纸。

295
00:12:48.540 --> 00:12:55.260
I was an extra on the movie Pleasantville starring Reese Witherspoon and Tobey Maguire, and I
我曾在瑞茜·威瑟斯彭和托比·马奎尔主演的电影《欢乐谷》里当群演，我

296
00:12:55.260 --> 00:12:58.920
had to play a teenager, and that was really fun because I got to dress up in old-timey
得扮演一个青少年，那真的很有趣，因为我全程都得穿上

297
00:12:58.920 --> 00:12:59.960
clothes the whole time.
复古风格的衣服。

298
00:13:00.540 --> 00:13:02.080
But check this out.
但你听听这个。

299
00:13:02.200 --> 00:13:09.260
They came into the extras holding area because they needed three couples to make out in the
他们来到群演休息区，因为他们需要三对情侣在

