00:13:09.260 --> 00:13:10.120
backseat of a car.
汽车后座接吻。

301
00:13:10.260 --> 00:13:15.420
They were going to pan across all these different couples making out until they got to the car
他们原本打算扫拍所有这些正在亲热的情侣，直到镜头转到车那里

302
00:13:15.420 --> 00:13:16.520
with the lead actors.
也就是主演们所在的地方。

303
00:13:16.880 --> 00:13:18.300
Were you part of the makeout couples?
你当时也在那些亲热的情侣里吗？

304
00:13:18.300 --> 00:13:22.720
No, you would have become a featured extra if you did it and you got a bump in pay, but
没有，如果你参与了，就会成为特约群演，还能涨工资，但是

305
00:13:22.720 --> 00:13:24.640
I felt too shy, so I didn't volunteer.
我太害羞了，所以没报名。

306
00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:32.300
But lady, we had a very special background performer on this episode of The Office, and
但是女士，我们在这一集《办公室》里有一位非常特别的背景演员，

307
00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:36.880
it was Jenny Tan who runs the fan website officetally.com.
她就是运营粉丝网站 officetally.com 的珍妮·谭。

308
00:13:37.080 --> 00:13:37.680
Yes.
没错。

309
00:13:37.700 --> 00:13:43.920
We had all become friends with her, and she was invited to spend the entire week with
我们都和她成了朋友，她受邀和我们一起度过了一整周，

310
00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:48.000
us getting an exclusive look at the finale, and they asked her to be an extra.
